<title>FINLAND: Orion 1996 profit rises 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Orion 1996 profit rises 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     738 vs 670</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   9.81 vs 9.37</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    5.00 vs 4.00</p>
<p> Net sales					  4,283 vs 4,059</p>
<p> Operating profit				   632 vs 596</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish pharmaceuticals maker Orion-Yhtyma Oy had been for a 739 million markka profit before extraordinary items and tax.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 852 vs 800</p>
<p> Depreciation					 220 vs 204</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 106 vs 74 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary income				21 vs nil</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			   nil vs 2</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  759 vs 668</p>
<p> Taxes						  246 vs 198</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    72.7 vs 69.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish pharmaceuticals group is Orion-Yhtyma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
</text>
